cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Om du använder Svada-mini, citera det här arbetet. / If you use Svada-mini, please cite it."
title: "Svada-mini: a local demonstration of a data space for water and wastewater data"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hagström"
    given-names: "Björn"
  - family-names: "Fjellman"
    given-names: "Niklas"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/GoteborgsStad/svada"
url: "https://vattendatalabbet.se"
abstract: >-
  A local, working demonstration of a data space for water and wastewater data, made within the Swedish Water Data Lab (SVADA, City of Gothenburg,
  in cooperation with RISE), using Eclipse EDC, the Dataspace Protocol, ODRL and verifiable credentials, with Orion-LD and Mintaka.
keywords:
  - data space
  - NGSI-LD
  - Eclipse EDC
  - Dataspace Protocol
  - ODRL
  - FIWARE
  - water and wastewater
date-released: "2026-10-27"
